Data sources
------------
This project reads publicly available data from the website deweloperuch.pl.
Through that service it reaches:

  - transaction data of the Real Estate Price Register (RCN, Rejestr Cen
    Nieruchomosci); the authors of deweloperuch.pl publish raw RCN data under
    the CC0 licence in their public repository;
  - statistics of the Central Statistical Office of Poland (GUS, Glowny Urzad
    Statystyczny) and of the National Bank of Poland (NBP, Narodowy Bank
    Polski). When you republish such figures, name GUS or NBP as the source.

Test data
---------
The directories docs/discovery/samples/ and tests/fixtures/ contain trimmed
responses obtained from deweloperuch.pl (and, through it, from RCN, GUS and
NBP). They are included only so that the tests can run offline against real
response shapes. They are not covered by the MIT licence and remain subject to
the terms of their respective owners. Personal data was removed from them.

